          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP147 Fort MacLeod&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Still making detours on the way home. This was a new kind of cap for me. Googling will be required later. Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
